flowchart TD
    %% a room is one document: domain, permalink and overlay owner
    ws[Socket join from Fluid] --> key[RoomKey]
    key --> d[domain]
    key --> p[permalink]
    key --> o{Domain reviews changes?}
    o -- no --> shared[owner None: the folder's own document]
    o -- yes --> draft[owner: the author whose draft it is]
    shared & draft --> room[(Room: yrs Doc plus awareness)]
